19
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:33,749
why should software developers care about writing anything else besides code?

20
00:01:33,759 --> 00:01:39,830
so if you make something your job isn't done just because you wrote a piece of code.

21
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:44,069
and let's say for the sake of argument it's the best piece of code ever written.

22
00:01:44,079 --> 00:01:47,990
